cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TrackpadProMax: pressure-sensitive gestures and haptic feedback for the macOS Force Touch trackpad"
abstract: >-
  TrackpadProMax is an open-source macOS application that exposes the raw
  multitouch and force data of Apple Force Touch trackpads and maps
  pressure tiers, multi-finger taps and surface zones to user-defined actions,
  with programmable Taptic Engine haptic feedback.
authors:
  - family-names: "Ensar"
    given-names: "Serhan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SerhanEnsar/TrackpadProMax"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - macOS
  - Force Touch
  - trackpad
  - haptic feedback
  - Taptic Engine
  - multitouch
  - pressure-sensitive input
  - gesture recognition
  - human-computer interaction
type: software
